    12287   run cd-mrkt_update-marketer in this-procedure (
    12288                                                   input for-cash-desk.db-num
    12289                                                   ,input for-cash-desk.obj-code
    12290                                                   ,input for-cash-desk.pos-type
    12291                                                   ,input for-cash-desk.cash-num
    12292                                                   ,input no
    12293                                                 )  .
